        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger </strong>The Stonewyrm rolls initiative.</p><p><strong>Effect </strong>Put Geokinetic Mastery in the initiative order <em>directly before the Stonewyrm. </em>Creatures cannot delay between Geokinetic Mastery and the Stonewyrm. If a creature's initiative would be moved before the Stonewyrm (such as if they go to dying), place them before Geokinetic Mastery instead.</p><p><strong>Special </strong>If the Stonewyrm does not roll highest in initiative, begin Geokinetic Mastery's routine as part of this reaction at the start of combat, before any PCs take their turn.</p>"
        },
