          "value": "<p>On its initiative, use one of four battlefield effects below. This ability must cycle through every effect before it can repeat. When this ability is used again, all ongoing effects from the previous instance immediately end.</p><hr /><p><strong>Spike Stones </strong>The Stonewyrm conjures long, sharp spikes of solid rock in two @Template[burst|distance:20]s. These areas are difficult terrain and hazardous terrain, and they disappear at the start of the Geokinetic Mastery's next turn.</p><p>Creatures on the ground take @Damage[(@actor.flags.pf2e.spikeDamage*1)[piercing]|options:flat,area-damage,hazardous-terrain] damage for each square of spiked stone they enter, combined and taken once at the end of the creature's movement action.</p><p>(Damage buttons below for ease, click what you need.)</p><p>@Damage[(@actor.flags.pf2e.spikeDamage*1)[piercing]|options:flat,area-damage,hazardous-terrain] @Damage[(@actor.flags.pf2e.spikeDamage*2)[piercing]|options:flat,area-damage,hazardous-terrain] @Damage[(@actor.flags.pf2e.spikeDamage*3)[piercing]|options:flat,area-damage,hazardous-terrain] @Damage[(@actor.flags.pf2e.spikeDamage*4)[piercing]|options:flat,area-damage,hazardous-terrain] @Damage[(@actor.flags.pf2e.spikeDamage*5)[piercing]|options:flat,area-damage,hazardous-terrain] @Damage[(@actor.flags.pf2e.spikeDamage*6)[piercing]|options:flat,area-damage,hazardous-terrain] @Damage[(@actor.flags.pf2e.spikeDamage*7)[piercing]|options:flat,area-damage,hazardous-terrain] @Damage[(@actor.flags.pf2e.spikeDamage*8)[piercing]|options:flat,area-damage,hazardous-terrain]</p><hr /><p><strong>Earthen Grasp </strong>Earthen claws erupt from the earth. All creatures must succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:36|traits:primal,earth,magical] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} on a critical failure) until the start of Geokinetic Mastery's next turn. [[/act escape dc=30 traits=primal,earth,magical]]</p><hr /><p><strong>Seismic Tremor </strong>The earth trembles and roils. All creatures must succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:36|traits:primal,earth,magical] save or be knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Scouring Sand </strong>Dirt and dust fills the arena. All creatures must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:36|traits:primal,earth,magical] save, becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} on a failure (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} on a critical failure) until the start of Geokinetic Mastery's next turn.</p>"
